[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4569.99, "timestamp": "01:16:09", "text": "但你甚至不会知道它是蓝色的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4573.43, "timestamp": "01:16:13", "text": "或者红色，因为我现在完全把它盖住了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4577.03, "timestamp": "01:16:17", "text": "那么，该怎么办？是吗？好的。如果我混合"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4583.03, "timestamp": "01:16:23", "text": "不，这太过分了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4587.27, "timestamp": "01:16:27", "text": "屏幕呢？这太过分了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4590.79, "timestamp": "01:16:30", "text": "啊，那也太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4596.709, "timestamp": "01:16:36", "text": "是的。你好，Chugens。你好吗？它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4607.03, "timestamp": "01:16:47", "text": "变暗？看起来好奇怪。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4608.95, "timestamp": "01:16:48", "text": "好的。我们不会把它混合在一起。好的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4614.44, "timestamp": "01:16:54", "text": "不需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4616.47, "timestamp": "01:16:56", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4618.63, "timestamp": "01:16:58", "text": "很大啊。"}]